#QCIR-G14
# qcir.md §4.3. g2 is not reachable from the output, so the semantics ignores
# it. Emitting it would add a constraint the formula does not have AND would
# introduce zzz and qqq, which appear nowhere else -- so the translation would
# report a different variable count for the same formula.
output(g1)
g1 = and(a)
g2 = and(zzz, qqq)
